  "description": "Sometimes, simplicity rules the nacho game. We recreate the Texas tradition of freshly fried chips individually topped with Longhorn cheese and a pickled jalapeño slice: a perfectly balanced snack.",
  "notes": "Optional substitutions: canola oil → peanut oil\n\nNotes: Longhorn cheese, a type of Colby, is the authentic (and in my opinion, superior) choice. If you cannot find Longhorn locally, try substituting Colby or one of the cheeses I mention above.",
